WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.293
First, launch Copilot CLI.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:12.384
Type /ask followed by a quick side question, like what no-ff means in git merge.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.061
Copilot thinks, then answers in a temporary side panel.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.339
It explains that no-ff forces a merge commit, and sketches the branch history.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.807
Press escape to dismiss it.

00:00:30.807 --> 00:00:34.545
Like a private aside, it never joins the main history.
